<title>USA: USDA extends GSM-103 credit to China for FY97.</title>
<headline>USDA extends GSM-103 credit to China for FY97.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Wednesday authorized $2 million in credit guarantees for sales of U.S. breeder livestock to China under the Intermediate Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-103) for fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>Last month, USDA offered China $100 million in credit guarantees under the shorter-term GSM-102 program.</p>
</text>
